  "summary": "W52 accounts ordinary path requests for selected item and creature loaders and the flat item texture directory scan. The pinned STL model covers query retries for absolute and weakly canonical paths, lexical tokens and iterator copies, path string conversion, and directory backing through the existing catalog envelope. Nine Release cases compare against the unchanged filesystem results, exercise long and missing paths, and verify allocation refusal and retirement. The native startup and inventory fixtures observe the path conversions. The Release OpenGL fixture exercises the real item texture directory scan during cold model lookup and retry. All 46 Release regression groups and 14 related checks pass.",
